    <mxCell id="e7" value="mounted at" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5b6167;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8a8f96;dashed=1;endArrow=none;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="db" target="vol">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="legend" value="Configuration notes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f6f5f1;strokeColor=#d8d5cd;fontColor=#1a1d1f;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="1300" width="1360" height="140" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend1" value="1. EnvironmentType: SingleInstance (set via .ebextensions AND eb create --single) is what removes the ELB — everything else is identical to v1's compose file." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1340" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend2" value="2. No RDS: db is a plain container with an EBS-backed Docker volume, same pattern as v1 — this is the only v2 variant that inherits v1's tiering completely unmodified." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1364" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend3" value="3. Deployed with the eb CLI (eb init / eb create --single / eb deploy), not Terraform." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#1a1d1f;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="90" y="1388" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
